#: ../../docs/webmcp/README.md:46 4ba34702dff34bc4bb07e02f2221b794
msgid ""
"The companion projection deliberately removes the hero's name and "
"identifier, seed material, inventory labels, evidence content, raw answers, "
"raw prompts, provider sessions, and credential-shaped fields. The state "
"declares `canonicalStateOwner: algoquest`; Scholarium only reads the "
"projection and stages returns."
msgstr ""
"The companion projection deliberately removes the hero's name and "
"identifier, seed material, inventory labels, evidence content, raw answers, "
"raw prompts, provider sessions, and credential-shaped fields. The state "
"declares `canonicalStateOwner: algoquest`; Scholarium only reads the "
"projection and stages returns."

